('Care', 'Seychelles', 2026, 'When you contact Ijoba Travels and they ask, "What do you want, and how do you want it?" they genuinely mean it. They take the time to understand exactly what you''re looking for and then deliver an experience that exceeds your expectations.

That was exactly how my Seychelles trip turned out. It was everything I imagined and more. I wanted a peaceful escape where I could relax, recharge, and still enjoy memorable experiences, all while staying within my budget, and they delivered exactly that.

From the breathtaking beaches and stunning scenery to the seamless travel arrangements and thoughtful recommendations, every part of the journey was carefully planned. I never had to worry about the logistics, which allowed me to simply soak in the beauty of Seychelles and enjoy every moment. It was the perfect balance of relaxation and exploration.

What impressed me most was how well they listened to what I wanted. This wasn''t just another travel package; it was tailored specifically to my preferences. Finding a travel agency that combines personalization, quality, and affordability is rare, but Ijoba Travels did just that.

Thank you for making the trip a reality and for aiding to  create memories that will stay with me forever. I highly recommend Ijoba Travels to anyone looking for a well planned, stress free travel experience. Ijoba!!! Unto the next trip…', 'https://dhuahskektxsztgyetnl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/destinations/testimonials/care_1791298013717.png', 'approved', 'admin', 0),
('Philemon', 'Nigeria', 2026, 'Ijoba Travels designed the ultimate vacation for us. We were completely swept away, moving seamlessly from the vibrant, electric rhythm of Lagos to the serene, magical wonder of Ikogosi Warm Springs. The refreshing scenery of where the cold and warm springs meet but do not mix was really mind blowing.
