If you want a spectacular, stress-free getaway that you''ll remember forever, look no further!', 'https://dhuahskektxsztgyetnl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/destinations/testimonials/philemon_1791298016177.png', 'approved', 'admin', 1),
('Israel', 'Kenya', 2026, 'From our very first conversation, I knew I wasn''t just getting another generic vacation package. Ijoba Travels actually listened. They took my personal preferences and turned them into a bespoke itinerary crafted entirely for me. It is incredibly rare to find an agency that delivers this level of deep personalization and premium quality without breaking the bank, but they pulled it off effortlessly.
