('Juliet', 'Seychelles & Kenya', 2026, 'My experience with Ijoba Travels was nothing short of amazing. The trip was very affordable, yet the quality exceeded my expectations. We visited both Seychelles and Kenya and stayed in beautiful city-view and sea-view apartments that offered great comfort and value for money. One of the highlights of the trip was the wide variety of activities available—there were so many that we couldn''t even keep up with all of them! What made the experience even more enjoyable was the flexibility to choose and add activities on the go, allowing us to personalize our itinerary and make every day more exciting. The planning, organization, and support from the Ijoba Travels team were excellent from start to finish. I highly recommend Ijoba Travels to anyone looking for an affordable, well-organized, and unforgettable travel experience.', 'https://dhuahskektxsztgyetnl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/destinations/testimonials/juliet_1791298020022.jpg', 'approved', 'admin', 3);
